---
const title = "GhatWe";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>{title} — Stories from the Western Ghats</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="GhatWe — stories, people, places and landscapes of the Western Ghats."
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="logo">GHATWE</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="#stories">Stories</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">GHATWE.IN</p>

        <h1>Stories from<br />the Western Ghats.</h1>

        <p class="intro">
          A growing collection of stories about the landscapes, people,
          rivers, forests and lives of the Ghats.
        </p>

        <a class="button" href="#stories">Explore GhatWe</a>
      </section>

      <section class="statement">
        <p>
          The Western Ghats are more than a mountain range.
          They are a living world.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="stories" class="stories">
        <p class="eyebrow">BEGINNING</p>
        <h2>The first stories are coming.</h2>
        <p>
          GhatWe is starting small — learning, listening and telling
          stories that help us see the Western Ghats differently.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section id="about" class="about">
        <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT GHATWE</p>
        <h2>Learning to love a landscape.</h2>
        <p>
          This is the beginning of a long journey through the Western Ghats.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>GhatWe.in</span>
      <span>Western Ghats, India</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    background: #f5f1e8;
    color: #243128;
  }

  header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 28px 5vw;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  nav a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  nav a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: 78vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 100px 5vw;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(56px, 9vw, 120px);
    line-height: 0.92;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 42px 0 32px;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    width: fit-content;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    background: #243128;
    color: #f5f1e8;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .statement {
    background: #243128;
    color: #f5f1e8;
    padding: 120px 10vw;
  }

  .statement p {
    max-width: 900px;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .stories,
  .about {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 130px 5vw;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .stories > p:last-child,
  .about > p:last-child {
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid #c9c2b4;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 28px 5vw;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    header {
      padding: 22px 6vw;
    }

    nav {
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 75vh;
      padding: 80px 6vw;
    }

    .statement {
      padding: 90px 6vw;
    }

    .stories,
    .about {
      padding: 90px 6vw;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 24px 6vw;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
  }
</style>